@attribute [Route(GlobalValues.Path_Components_Announcement_History)]

<PageTitle>@GlobalValues.Page_Title_Components_Announcement_History</PageTitle>

<h1 class="page-heading">@GlobalValues.Page_Heading_Components_Announcement_History Component</h1>

<p>
    The <span class="code-span">&lt;AnnouncementHistory /&gt;</span> component allows the user to view the last 20 announcements made via the live region service.
</p>
<p>
    The announcement history viewer is a non-modal dialog that can be accessed at any time by using <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>H</kbd> or by clicking
    on its associated button, which can either remain visible all the time or only when it is focused <span class="code-span">:focus-visible</span>.
</p>
<p>
    <b>Important: </b>In order to use the <span class="code-span">&lt;AnnouncementHistory /&gt;</span> component contained in the <span class="code-span">BlazorRamp.Core</span> NuGet package,
    please ensure that it has been added to your project as described on the <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Class" href="@GlobalValues.Path_Overview_Getting_Started">
        @GlobalValues.Main_Nav_Section_Heading_About - @GlobalValues.Page_Heading_Overview_Getting_Started
    </a> page.
</p>
<p>
    <b>Try it:</b> Click the Theme button (top right of the screen, really an aria switch) which uses the live region service, then use the short cut keys or click the alerts button at the bottom 
    right of the screen to see the entry made.
</p>
<section class="code-table">

    <h2 id="announcement-history-component" class="code-table__heading">AnnouncementHistory component</h2>

    <table aria-labelledby="announcement-history-component">

        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th scope="col">Parameter</th>
                <th scope="col">Type</th>
                <th scope="col">Description</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>Title</td>
                <td>string</td>
                <td>
                    The h2 heading text displayed for the announcement history dialog and used for the aria-labelledby attribute.
                    A default value of "Recent Announcements" will be used if omitted.
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>CloseText</td>
                <td>string</td>
                <td>
                    The text for the button that closes the history dialog.
                    A default value of "Close" will be used if omitted.
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>ClearCloseText</td>
                <td>string</td>
                <td>
                    The text for the button that clears the announcement history logs and closes the dialog.
                    A default value of "Clear & Close" will be used if omitted.
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>RefreshText</td>
                <td>string</td>
                <td>
                    The text for the button that refreshes the history list displayed in the dialog.
                    A default value of "Refresh" will be used if omitted.
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>NoDataText</td>
                <td>string</td>
                <td>
                    The text displayed when there are no announcements in the history.
                    A default value of "No Announcements" will be used if omitted.
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>TriggerText</td>
                <td>string</td>
                <td>
                    The text for the trigger button that opens the history dialog.
                    A default value of "Alerts" will be used if omitted.
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>TriggerVisible</td>
                <td>bool</td>
                <td>
                    Determines if the trigger button is always visible or only visible when focused via the keyboard.
                    <b>The default value is false, so it will be hidden by default</b>. Please ensure to advise users of the
                    short cut keys.
                </td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

</section>

<section>
    <h2 class="page-heading">Setting Component Parameters</h2>

    <p>Example showing all of the parameters being set:</p>

    <CodeBox CodeBlock="@CodeSnippets.Add_Configure_Announcement_History_Component" AriaLabel="Component parameter code block" />

    <p>
        The announcement history will display the following information as a single string entry separated by semi-colons for each 
        list item in its list, starting with the most recent announcement:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>
            The elapsed time since the announcement was made.
        </li>
        <li>The page title of the page where the announcement was made; blank if there was no page title.</li>
        <li>The triggering element such as "Save Customer Button"; blank if the information was not provided.</li>
        <li>The message provided.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        The page title and triggering element provide context for the user, so I would ensure that your pages have titles and that you 
        provide the name of the triggering element such as "Save Customer Button".
    </p>
</section>

